    {
      "id": 119158,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-12T12:31:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The \"or\" is pretty big there.</p><p>You don't get to search both, you would pick one and search it.</p><p>Of course if you want to let someone do both after they messed up and make choose the wrong one for the card they want that is up to you, I would allow it for newer players (or new to that character).</p><p>But searching both isn't what the card intends at all. &nbsp;I probably wouldn't let an experienced player search both, and I don't do it myself when I mess up. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:52:16.800Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11388,
