      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The &quot;or&quot; is pretty big there.</p><p>You don&#39;t get to search both, you would pick one and search it.</p><p>Of course if you want to let someone do both after they messed up and make choose the wrong one for the card they want that is up to you, I would allow it for newer players (or new to that character).</p><p>But searching both isn&#39;t what the card intends at all. &nbsp;I probably wouldn&#39;t let an experienced player search both, and I don&#39;t do it myself when I mess up. &nbsp;</p>",
