      "id": 119159,
      "name": "Nielzabub",
      "username": "Nielzabub",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-12T12:35:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would suggest searching your trash first. If you search your deck, but the instrument you want isn't there, than you either have to shuffle it, or have an unfair advantage by knowing what cards are next.</p>",
